  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. It's given that the values of <math alttext=\"upper P\"><mi>P</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"upper N\"><mi>N</mi>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"upper C\"><mi>C</mi>\n</math> are positive. Therefore, dividing each side of the given equation by <math alttext=\"upper N\"><mi>N</mi>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"StartFraction upper P Over upper N EndFraction equals 19 minus upper C\"><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></math>. Subtracting <math alttext=\"19\"><mn>19</mn>\n</math> from each side of this equation yields <math alttext=\"StartFraction upper P Over upper N EndFraction minus 19 equals negative upper C\"><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></math>. Dividing each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"negative 1\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"19 minus StartFraction upper P Over upper N EndFraction equals upper C\"><mn>19</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, or&nbsp;<math alttext=\"upper C equals 19 minus StartFraction upper P Over upper N EndFraction\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math alttext=\"upper P equals upper N upper C minus 19\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></math>, not <math alttext=\"upper P equals upper N left parenthesis 19 minus upper C right parenthesis\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>19</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math alttext=\"upper P equals 19 minus upper N upper C\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>C</mi></math>, not <math alttext=\"upper P equals upper N left parenthesis 19 minus upper C right parenthesis\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>19</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math alttext=\"upper P equals upper N left parenthesis upper C minus 19 right parenthesis\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"upper P equals upper N left parenthesis 19 minus upper C right parenthesis\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>19</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>",
